{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05521","headline":"登福先寺上方然公禅室 · 蔡希寂","name":"登福先寺上方然公禅室","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名都标佛刹，梵构临河干。\n举目上方峻，森森青翠攒。\n步登诸劫尽，忽造浮云端。\n当暑敞扃闼，却嫌絺綌寒。\n禅房最高顶，静者殊闲安。\n疎雨向空城，数峯帘外盘。\n午钟振衣坐，招我同一餐。\n真味杂饴露，衆香唯茝兰。\n晚来恣偃俛，茶果仍留欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡希寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}